{"meta":{"format_version":"4.5","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"fish_trout","model_identifier":"trout","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"Survive and Conquer \u2014 TROUT\n============================================================\nstream trout: fusiform, forked caudal, adipose, olive with dark spots\n\nSCALE\n  1 unit = 2.8125 cm\n  length: 18.00 u = 50.62 cm = 0.506 m\n  body depth (excl. fins): 3.40 u = 9.6 cm  (half-ht param 1.70)\n  body width: 1.60 u = 4.5 cm\n  hit box (W x H x D): 2.8 x 5.5 x 18.5 u\n\nORIGIN\n  Mid-body centre at (0,0,0). Facing -Z (head toward -Z, tail +Z).\n  Belly sits below y=0 by ~half body height; game places the unit at swim depth.\n  Creature right = +X.\n\nCUBES: 32   BONES: 14\n  chain: root > body_front > body_mid > body_rear > tail > caudal\n  fins: dorsal, anal, pectoral_r/l, pelvic_r/l, adipose\n\nANIMATIONS\n  idle: 2.000 s, loop=loop\n  swim: 0.800 s, loop=loop\n  swim designed speed: 1.20 m/s = 42.7 u/s (in-place cycle; game translates the root)\n  idle: gentle fin scull + slow body sway, 2.00 s loop\n\nNo attack / death / injured clips (commission: idle + swim only).\n\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"snout","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.616,-0.4675,-9.0],"to":[0.616,0.5143,-7.92],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,-6.822],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[117.0,1.0,118.0,2.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[118.0,1.0,119.0,2.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[119.0,1.0,120.0,2.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[116.0,1.0,117.0,2.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[117.0,0.0,118.0,1.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[118.0,0.0,119.0,1.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ecd02f74-86b2-5457-bcf9-274c63347507"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":tr